"The game ran out of address space, not memory: iOS refused to set aside more addresses for it. An app without the extended virtual addressing entitlement gets only a few GB of addresses, and installs re-signed with your own Apple account or team often lose that entitlement. Install Husk with it kept, then start the game again." = "游戏耗尽的是地址空间，而不是内存：iOS 拒绝再为它预留地址。没有“扩展虚拟寻址”（extended virtual addressing）权限的应用只能使用几 GB 的地址，而用你自己的 Apple 账户或团队重新签名的安装常常会丢失这项权限。请以保留该权限的方式安装 Husk，然后重新启动游戏。";
